WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.900
Every box on a ship has a number.

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.050
At two a.m., the lights went out.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.500
Eleven minutes later… one box was gone.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:19.400
My name was on the manifest.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:26.000
Now every crew from here to Kaigan wants it back.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.700
They think I know where it is.

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:22.200
They're right.
